      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i write is just... empty. like i'm just rearranging words to cover up the fact that there's nothing actually there. i've been sitting here for hours thinking about how much easier it would be to just stop trying to pretend. everything feels so heavy and pointless lately. it's like the only real, honest thing left is the idea of just letting go of it all.",
